OL,3,AGreen Party at 'crossroads', says
OL,4,Aformer co-leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Green Party is at a "crossroads"
OL,7,Fand needs to focus on its "core
OL,8,Fvalues", a former party co-leader has
OL,9,Ftold the BBC, weeks after members
OL,10,Fadopted a motion declaring Zionism a
OL,11,Fform of racism.
OL,13,FAdrian Ramsay suggested the Greens need
OL,14,Ftheir policies to appeal to a majority
OL,15,Fof British voters if they want to bring
OL,16,Fthe "environmental changes that we
OL,17,Fneed" and advised against taking an
OL,18,Fapproach that risks being "quite
OL,19,Fdivisive".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
