OL,3,AGreen Party at 'crossroads', says
OL,4,Aformer co-leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen Party leader Zack Polanski
OL,7,Fresponded by saying there was "no
OL,8,Fenvironmental justice without social,
OL,9,Fracial and economic justice".
OL,11,FThe motion, which Polanski did not take
OL,12,Fpart in or vote upon, defined Zionism
OL,13,Fas an ideology supporting "an
OL,14,Fethnonationalist Jewish state" that had
OL,15,Fled to the "disenfranchisement and
OL,16,Fdestruction" of Palestinians.
